  "description": "Everything that other e-road bikes aren’t: The Roadmachine 01 AMP ONE is uniquely engineered for high mileage with hidden power. Innovative and researched, we’re continuing the Roadmachine’s lineage by allying a technically refined design with the exceptionally light and quiet class 3 TQ-HPR50 drive unit. Seamlessly integrated into the Premium Carbon frame, everything adds up to make this a favorite for endurance: note the Shimano Ultegra Di2 groupset, ICS2 stem and CRD-400 SL wheels. In short, it’s an elevated BMC design, amplified to meet the timeless needs of the Roadmachine rider.",
